                    Purchasing a residence is among the most consequential decisions a family makes. We treat that confidence with absolute seriousness.
                </p>

                <div class="feature-list">
                    <div class="feature-list-item">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M5 8.2L7 10.2L11 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                        <span><strong>Uncompromising focus on a single signature project</strong> — all management attention is concentrated right here on site.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-list-item">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M5 8.2L7 10.2L11 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                        <span><strong>Honest carpet-to-super-area ratios</strong> — maximizing functional, usable living area within every residence.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-list-item">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M5 8.2L7 10.2L11 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                        <span><strong>Direct developer communication</strong> — speak directly with advisors and decision-makers rather than impersonal call centers.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-list-item">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M5 8.2L7 10.2L11 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                        <span><strong>Long-term value creation</strong> — architecture that withstands passing design trends to maintain pride and resale value over decades.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="margin-top:28px;">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-gold" onclick="openEnquiryModal()">
                        <span>Schedule Private Conversation</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- 5. CTA Banner -->
<section class="cta-banner">
